                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu mwiiko kunyoa nikwo Sairasi abeelamo omwami owe Bapasha, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhola niko aloma khubirira khu mung'oosi Yeremia. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhola Sairasi omwami owe Bapasha arusia lilaka mu bwami bwewe bwoosi. Ne lundi aandika lilaka elio naloma ali:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
